  "note_B163": "FIPS186-2 gives b for B-163 in both polynomial basis (2 0a601907 ...) and normal basis (6 645f3cac f1638e13 9c6cd13e f61734fb c9e3d9fb). My SHA-1 derivation from the seed reproduces the NORMAL-basis b exactly (0x6645f3cacf1638e139c6cd13ef61734fbc9e3d9fb), so the seed verifies; my SEC2 checker flagged sect163r2/233/283/409/571 as False only because SEC2 prints the polynomial-basis b. Anthropic reports the B-163 seed itself as the one they could not explain."
